//
// The server evaluates each tenant policy against the input of server/services/policy/policy-evaluator.ts: a synthetic trace
// (decision-core.ts buildDecisionTrace, hooks branch), the canonical tool-call object (tool-call-input.ts buildHooksToolCall),
